<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus invites tender for 25,000 tonnes barley.</title>
<headline>Cyprus invites tender for 25,000 tonnes barley.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Thursday invited tenders for the supply of 25,000 tonnes of barley with a shipment date by May 20, 1997.</p>
<p>Tenders close on April 15, a statement from the grain commission said.</p>
</text>
